Tins of spinach or food rations, both of which have more nutrition.
Though since the ring of slow digestion has been added to the game, I
often prefer to carry around a few C rations instead, as they're
lighter and can be eaten in one turn. Royal jelly and lembas wafers
are even more preferable when I can get them; I don't think the former
can be polypiled for, though, and the latter is quite rare.

In any case, they're only collateral in the large stack of armor from
fallen soldiers than I'm polypiling, though lately I've found more
luck polypiling the fewer items in the Castle storeroom as magical
armor seems to turn up more frequently there. (Lieutenants are not
normally generated wearing cursed levitation boots...)

